965 0 obj
  << /ActualText (SprintZero \024 Target Architecture \050North Star\051\n\nGoverning principle\nEmbeddings do the work\056 Structure makes it inspectable\056 Evaluation makes it improvable\056\n\nThe full pipeline\n\nUser Query \223 Query Expansion          \220 lightweight LLM pre\055pass \050enrichment\054 not classification\051 \223 Parallel Retrieval       \220 all collections queried simultaneously\054 no routing gates \223 Scoring \053 Metadata Boost \220 embeddings primary\054 metadata nudges only \223 Diversity Enforcement    \220 minimum coverage rules\054 foundational injection if needed \223 Structured Synthesis     \220 composition prompt defines reasoning contract \223 Answer \053 Gap Flags       \220 answer always includes what\047s missing\054 not just what\047s known\nFour knowledge collections\nCollectionRoleChunk unitFoundationalWHY \024 principles\054 cognitive biases\054 research fundamentalsOne concept\054 fully explainedAppliedHOW \024 patterns\054 anti\055patterns\054 flowsOne solution\054 with context and rationaleContextualWHERE \024 domain constraints\054 regulations\054 mental modelsOne domain scenario\054 fully describedSituationalTHIS \024 transcripts\054 briefs\054 project dataChunked by topic \057 speaker \057 phase\nMetadata schema \050minimal\054 maintainable\051\n\173 \042type\042\072 \042foundational \174 applied \174 contextual \174 situational\042\054 \042topics\042\072 \133\042onboarding\042\054 \042compliance\042\135\054 \042domain\042\072 \133\042fintech\042\054 \042general\042\135\054 \042strength\042\072 \042canonical \174 established \174 anecdotal\042 \175\nDesigned failure modes\nSituationSystem responseDomain not detectedAnswer on Foundational \053 Applied\073 flags what domain context would addOnly patterns retrieveAuto\055inject highest\055scoring Foundational chunkProject context contradicts principlesComposition prompt requires explicit conflict namingQuery too vagueBroad retrieval\073 lower confidence signalled in outputMissing corpusAnswer proceeds \053 gap flag\072 \042No \133domain\135 context \024 answer based on general patterns only\042\nBuild sequence \050not now \024 reference only\051\nPhase 1 \024 2 files \050Foundational \053 Applied\051\054 raw embedding\054 no metadata\054 5 benchmark queries Phase 2 \024 Add Contextual\054 add metadata \053 topic boost\054 re\055run benchmarks Phase 3 \024 Add diversity enforcement \053 composition prompt Phase 4 \024 Add Situational \050project context\051 \053 gap flagging Phase 5 \024 Failure mode responses \053 ambiguous query benchmarks\nOrchestration layer\nOpenClaw\054 running locally on MacBook Pro\056 Python \053 VS Code for implementation\056 Each phase introduces one layer of complexity\054 testable in isolation before the next is added\056\nThat\047s your FigJam source\056 The pipeline diagram in the middle is the spine \024 everything else hangs off it\056 When you\047re ready to move from north star to actual RAG file definitions\054 that\047s the next conversation\056)
     /K [ 110 ]
     /P 966 0 R
     /Pg 749 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

